function applyFrontierRules(v,r){if(!r)return r;const de=delta(v,'expansion'),du=delta(v,'urbanization'),ds=delta(v,'survival');r.autoDensity=clamp(Number(r.autoDensity||2.5)*(1-de*.20+du*.10+ds*.04),1.7,4.2);r.reinforceDensity=clamp(Number(r.reinforceDensity||3.25)*(1-de*.12+du*.08),2.3,4.8);r.sourceReserve=clamp(Number(r.sourceReserve||28)-de*8+ds*7,20,42);if(de<-.25||du>.35)r.minRemainAdults=Math.max(Number(r.minRemainAdults||1),2);return r;}
